Package: Houdini
Type: Package
Title: Automatic Table & Figure Insertion into Data Containing Documents
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: c(person ("Aaron", "Godwood", role = c("aut", "cre"),
                    email = "godwoodaaron@gmail.com"),
             person ("Valerie", "Millar", role = "aut",
                    email = "v.millar@moonlaketx.com"))
Description: A tool for the automatic insertion of RTF tables and figures into Word (.docx)
    documents at specified bookmarks. It parses RTF output (the kind produced by SAS),
    lets you interactively filter and trim each table with an excel or in app configuration,
    and writes a fully-formatted Word document with native OOXML tables.
